  "strategy": "BR Goblin aristocrats — blight drain / reach",
  "colors": "BR",
  "identity": "BR Goblin Aristocrats, rebuilt around the fact that this cube contains ZERO sacrifice outlets — no card in the 282-card pool reads \"Sacrifice a creature:\". The substitute is blight N (put N -1/-1 counters on a creature you control), which kills a 1/1 Goblin token on demand. The deck converts every blight into damage three ways at once: Lasting Tarfire deals 2 to each opponent at any end step in which a counter was placed, Sting-Slinger turns its own blight activation into 2 damage, and Boggart Cursecrafter plus Boggart Mischief convert the consumed Goblin into 1 damage and 1 drain. Every removal spell is chosen to pay the engine — Cinder Strike, Requiting Hex, Bogslither's Embrace and Blight Rot all place a counter — so an answer and an engine activation cost one card.",
